  "issue_comments": [
    {
      "body": "cc @bbrowning @arpera. This is a small fix for the Olmo3 reasoning parser. A literal `<think>` or `</think>` in the content restarted the streaming state machine and was deleted, so streaming output diverged from non-streaming. @arpera you wrote this parser originally. Could you take a look when you have time? Thanks.",
